@startuml
title ZGC 单轮 GC 循环（相位状态机）
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor white
left to right direction
hide empty description
state "Mark Start\n(STW 停顿, 亚毫秒)" as MS
state "Concurrent Mark\n(并发标记)" as CM
state "Mark End\n(STW 停顿)" as ME
state "Relocate Start\n(STW 停顿)" as RS
state "Concurrent Relocate\n(并发重定位)" as CR
[*] --> MS
MS --> CM : 扫根+设 good 色后放行\n并发标记开始
CM --> ME : 判定标记完成
ME --> RS : 处理弱引用后进入下一步
RS --> CR : 选 CSet+迁根后放行\n并发重定位开始
CR --> MS : 清空 region 即回收；\n下一轮 Mark Start 兼任 Remap
@enduml
